  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed advertisement consent for an externally illuminated projecting sign to the building between 1st January 2024 and 31st December 2028, by reason of its size, position, the long installing period, the absence of building improvement works and the lack of a genuine interest in redeveloping the building, would be an intrusive display in the long term and detrimental to the visual amenity of the locality and the surrounding area. The advert would therefore be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2, CC5 and NPPF Paragraph 141."
